Chapter: KeywordAsPatternVar

  cites Foreword chapter Maybe

 A pattern variable named with a reserved keyword must be rejected
 at parse time. Before this fix, the keyword token failed the
 is-ident check and silently became a WildPat, losing the binding.
 Using 'with' here because it does not start an expression form.

Section: Definitions

  extract : Maybe Integer -> Integer
  extract (m) = when m
    is Just (with) -> 1
    is None -> 0

  opening : Integer = extract (Just 42)

